# The same spell, both creatures controlled by human. The second target
# breaks TargetsWithDifferentControllers$ against the first, so only one of
# the two required targets survives (TargetMin$ 2) and Run Away Together is
# not cast: it stays in hand. castspell, not a queued action: a declined
# queued cast is a hard stop in passpriority.
startturn ai
advance 3
queue targets 1,4
castspell ai 3
